hadiths[296]{hadithnumber,text}:
"129","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabiullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Zuhr ka waqt jab suraj dhal jae aur aadmi ka saya us ke qad ke barabar ho jab tak Asr na aa jae; aur Asr ka waqt jab tak suraj peela na ho; aur Maghrib ki namaz ka waqt jab tak shafaq na chhup jae; aur Isha ki namaz ka waqt aadhi raat tak; aur Subah ki namaz ka waqt tulu' fajr se jab tak suraj na nikle. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke han Buraidah ki hadees mein Asr ke bare mein hai ke suraj safed shaffaf tha; aur Abu Musa ki hadees mein hai ke suraj buland tha."
"130","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Barzah Aslami se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Asr padhte, phir ham mein se koi apne makan ki taraf Madinah ke door tareen kinare mein wapas jata jabke suraj zinda [roshan] hota; aur Aap Isha ko moakhar karna pasand farmate; aur us se pahle sone aur us ke baad baat karne ko napasand farmate; aur Subah ki namaz se is waqt phirte jab aadmi apne sathi ko pahchanta, aur saath se sau tak [aayaat] padhte. Muttafaq alaih; aur un donon ke han Jabir ki hadees mein hai ke Isha kabhi kabhi: jab unhen jama dekhte jaldi karte aur jab der dekhte moakhar karte; aur Subah Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) andhere mein padhte the; aur Muslim ke han Abu Musa ki hadees mein hai ke Fajr is waqt qaem ki jab fajr phat gayi aur log ek doosre ko mushkil se pahchante the."
"131","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij se riwayat hai ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Maghrib padhte, phir ham mein se koi wapas jata jabke woh apne teeron ke girne ki jaghen dekhta tha. Muttafaq alaih."
"132","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek raat Isha mein andhera kar diya yahan tak ke aksar raat guzar gayi, phir bahar aae aur namaz padhai, aur farmaya: Beshak yahi us ka waqt hai agar main apni ummat par mashaqqat na dalta. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"133","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab garmi shadeed ho to namaz mein thandak karo, kyunke garmi ki shiddat jahannam ki bhaap se hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"134","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Subah ko roshan karo kyunke yeh tumhare ajron ke liye bada hai. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"135","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Subah ki ek rak'at suraj nikalne se pahle pa le us ne Subah pa li, aur jo Asr ki ek rak'at suraj doobne se pahle pa le us ne Asr pa li. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han Aishah se isi tarah hai aur unhon ne rak'at ki jagah sajda kaha, phir kaha ke sajda se murad rak'at hi hai."
"136","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Subah ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke suraj nikal aae, aur Asr ke baad koi namaz nahin yahan tak ke suraj doob jae. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke alfaz hain: Fajr ki namaz ke baad koi namaz nahin. Aur unhi ke han Uqbah bin Amir se hai ke teen ghadiyan thin jin mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen namaz padhne aur apne murdon ko dafan karne se mana farmate the: jab suraj chamakta nikle yahan tak ke buland ho jae, aur jab dopahar ka khada hone wala khada ho yahan tak ke suraj dhal jae, aur jab suraj doobne ke liye jhuk jae. Aur doosra hukm Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ke han Abu Hurairah ki hadees se za'if sanad ke sath hai, aur izafa kiya: siwae Juma ke din ke. Aur isi tarah Abu Dawud ke han Abu Qatadah se hai."
"137","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Bani Abd Manaf! Jo bhi is ghar ka tawaf kare aur namaz padhe use raat ya din ki kisi bhi ghadi mein na roko. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"138","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Shafaq surkhi hai. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur ghair ne is ke mauqoof hone ko sahih kaha."
"139","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fajr do hain: ek fajr jo khana haram karti hai aur us mein namaz halal hoti hai, aur ek fajr jis mein namaz haram hoti hai [yani Subah ki namaz] aur us mein khana halal hota hai. Ise Ibn Khuzaimah aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya aur donon ne ise sahih kaha; aur Hakim ke han Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees mein isi tarah hai aur us mein izafa kiya jo khana haram karti hai: Woh ufuq mein lambi phailti hai; aur doosri mein: Woh bhediye ki dum ki tarah hai."
"140","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Afzal a'mal namaz hai us ke awwal waqt mein. Ise Tirmidhi aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya aur donon ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ki asl Sahihain mein hai."
"141","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mahzurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Awwal waqt Allah ki khushnudi hai, darmiyan Allah ki rahmat hai, aur aakhir Allah ka afw hai. Ise Daraqutni ne bahut hi za'if sanad se riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi ke han Ibn Umar ki hadees se isi tarah hai darmiyan ke baghair, aur woh bhi za'if hai."
"142","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fajr ke baad do sajdon ke siwa koi namaz nahin. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya; aur Abdur Razzaq ki riwayat mein hai: Tulu' fajr ke baad Fajr ki do rak'aton ke siwa koi namaz nahin. Aur isi tarah Daraqutni ke han Ibn Amr bin Aas se hai."
"143","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Asr padhi, phir mere ghar mein dakhil hue aur do rak'aten padhin, to main ne poocha, to Aap ne farmaya: Main Zuhr ke baad ki do rak'aton se mashghool ho gaya tha, to abhi padhi hain. Main ne kaha: Kya jab ham se choot jaen to ham un ki qaza karen? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ke han Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se isi ma'na mein hai."
"144","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid bin Abd Rabbihi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mere gird ek aadmi phira jabke main soya hua tha, to us ne kaha: Tum kehte ho: Allahu akbar Allahu akbar, phir us ne azan ka zikr kiya takbir ko chaar martaba baghair tarji' ke, aur iqamat ek ek martaba siwae qad qamatis salah ke. Un hon ne kaha: Jab subah hui to main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak yeh sacha khwab hai... Al-hadees. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha; aur Ahmad ne us ke aakhir mein Bilal ke Fajr ki azan mein qaul 'Namaz neend se behtar hai' ka qissa ziyada kiya; aur Ibn Khuzaimah ke han Anas se hai ke unhon ne kaha: Sunnat mein se hai ke jab mu'adhdhin Fajr mein hayya alal falah kahe to kahe: Namaz neend se behtar hai."
"145","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mahzurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen azan sikhai aur us mein tarji' ka zikr kiya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; lekin unhon ne us ke awwal mein takbir ka zikr sirf do martaba kiya; aur Khamsa ne ise riwayat kiya aur chaar martaba zikr kiya."
"146","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Bilal ko hukm diya gaya ke azan ko dohra kahen aur iqamat ko ek martaba siwae iqamat ke, yani qaul qad qamatis salah ke. Muttafaq alaih, aur Muslim ne istisna ka zikr nahin kiya; aur Nasai ke han hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal ko hukm diya."
"147","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Bilal ko azan dete dekha aur main un ke munh ka ta'aqqub karta yahan aur wahan, jabke un ki ungliyan un ke kanon mein thin. Ise Ahmad aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha; aur Ibn Majah ke han hai ke unhon ne apni ungliyan kanon mein dalin; aur Abu Dawud ke han hai ke jab hayya alas salah par pahunche to gardan ko dayan baen moda aur ghume nahin; aur is ki asl Sahihain mein hai."
"148","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mahzurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ki awaz pasand aai to unhen azan sikhai. Ise Ibn Khuzaimah ne riwayat kiya."
"149","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath dono Eidein ek do martaba se ziyada baghair azan aur iqamat ke padhin. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur isi tarah Muttafaq mein Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) aur ghair se hai."
"150","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah se taweel hadees mein un ke namaz se so jane ke bare mein hai ke phir Bilal ne azan di aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi jaise har din karte the. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke han Jabir se hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Muzdalifah aae aur wahan Maghrib aur Isha ek azan aur do iqamaton se padhin; aur unhi ke han Ibn Umar se hai ke Maghrib aur Isha ko ek iqamat se jama kiya. Abu Dawud ne izafa kiya: Har namaz ke liye. Aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai ke un donon mein se kisi mein nida nahin ki."
"151","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar aur Aishah se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Bilal raat mein azan deta hai, to khao piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktum nida de; aur woh ek nabina aadmi the jo nida na dete yahan tak ke un se kaha jata: Subah ho gayi, subah ho gayi. Muttafaq alaih; aur us ke aakhir mein idraj hai."
"152","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Bilal ne Fajr se pahle azan di to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke wapas jaen aur nida den: Khabardar! Banda so gaya tha. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur ise za'if kaha."
"153","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum nida suno to wohi kaho jo mu'adhdhin kehta hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ke han Mu'awiyah se hai; aur Muslim ke han Umar se hai mu'adhdhin jaisa kehne ki fazilat kalima ba kalima, siwae do hay'alon ke, to kahe: La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah."
"154","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Abi al-Aas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe meri qaum ka imam bana den. Aap ne farmaya: Tum un ke imam ho, aur un mein sab se kamzor ki iqtida karo, aur aisa mu'adhdhin rakho jo apni azan par ujrat na le. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"155","[AI-translation] Hazrat Malik bin Huwairis (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Jab namaz aa jae to tum mein se koi azan de... Al-hadees. Ise Sab'a ne riwayat kiya."
"156","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal se farmaya: Jab tum azan do to thehar thehar kar do, aur jab iqamat kaho to jaldi karo, aur apni azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan itna fasla rakho jitne mein khane wala apne khane se farigh ho jae. Al-hadees. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise za'if kaha; aur unhi ke han Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Azan siwae ba-wuzu ke koi na de. Aur ise bhi za'if kaha; aur unhi ke han Ziyad bin Haris (Raziyallahu anhu) se hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo azan de wahi iqamat kahe. Aur ise bhi za'if kaha; aur Abu Dawud ke han Abdullah bin Zaid ki hadees mein hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne use dekha [yani azan] aur main hi use chahta tha. Aap ne farmaya: Tum hi iqamat kaho. Aur is mein bhi za'f hai."
"157","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mu'adhdhin azan ka ziyada haqdar hai aur imam iqamat ka ziyada haqdar hai. Ise Ibn Adi ne riwayat kiya aur ise za'if kaha; aur Baihaqi ke han isi tarah Ali ke qaul se hai."
"158","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Azan aur iqamat ke darmiyan dua radd nahin hoti. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"159","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo nida sunte waqt kahe: Aey Allah! Is kamil da'wat aur qaem hone wali namaz ke Rabb! Muhammad ko waseela aur fazilat ata farma aur unhen maqam mahmood par mab'oos farma jis ka Tu ne un se wa'da kiya hai, to us ke liye qayamat ke din meri shafa'at halal ho jati hai. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya."
"160","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Talq (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein hawa kharij kare to wapas jae aur wuzu kare aur namaz dohrae. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"161","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah baligh aurat ki namaz baghair dupatte ke qabool nahin karta. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"162","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Agar kapda kushada ho to use lapet lo [yani namaz mein]. Aur Muslim ke han hai ke us ke donon kinaron mein mukhalifat karo, aur agar tang ho to use tahband banao. Muttafaq alaih; aur un donon ke han Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees se hai ke tum mein se koi ek kapde mein namaz na padhe jabke us mein se us ke kandhe par kuch na ho."
"163","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kya aurat qameez aur dupatte mein baghair tahband ke namaz padhe? Aap ne farmaya: Jab qameez kushada ho jo us ke qadmon ke upar ko dhank le. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur aimma ne is ke mauqoof hone ko sahih kaha."
"164","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amir bin Rabi'ah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek andheri raat mein the to ham par qibla mushtabah ho gaya, to ham ne namaz padhi; phir jab suraj nikla to ham ne ghair qibla ki taraf namaz padhi thi, to nazil hui: Tum jidhar bhi munh karo udhar Allah ka chehra hai [Surah Baqarah: 115]. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise za'if kaha."
"165","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan qibla hai. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Bukhari ne ise qawi kaha."
"166","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amir bin Rabi'ah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apni sawari par namaz padhte dekha jidhar bhi woh le jati. Muttafaq alaih; Bukhari ne izafa kiya ke Aap sar se ishara farmate aur farz mein aisa na karte the; aur Abu Dawud ke han Anas ki hadees se hai ke jab safar mein hote aur nafl padhna chahte to apni untni se qibla ki taraf munh karte, takbir kehte, phir namaz padhte jidhar bhi sawari ka munh hota; aur is ki sanad hasan hai."
"167","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Saari zameen masjid hai siwae qabrastan aur hammam ke. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur is mein illat hai."
"168","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saat jaghon mein namaz padhne se mana farmaya: kuda-karkat, zabah khana, qabrastan, raste ke darmiyan, hammam, unton ke baithne ki jagah, aur Baitullah ki chhat ke upar. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise za'if kaha."
"169","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Marsad Ghanawi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Qabron ki taraf namaz na padho aur na un par baitho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"170","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid aae to dekhe, phir agar apne jooton mein takleef deh ya gandi cheez dekhe to use ponch de aur un mein namaz padhe. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"171","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne mouzon se gandagi ko raunde to un ki taharat mitti hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"172","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'awiyah bin Hakam (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak is namaz mein logon ki baat mein se koi cheez durust nahin, yeh to tasbih, takbir aur Quran ki qiraat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"173","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein namaz mein baat karte the, ham mein se koi apne sathi se apni hajat ke liye baat karta, yahan tak ke nazil hui: Namazon ki hifazat karo aur darmiyani namaz ki, aur Allah ke liye farmanbardar khade ho [Surah Baqarah: 238], to hamen khamoshi ka hukm diya gaya aur baat se mana kiya gaya. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"174","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tasbih mardon ke liye hai aur tali bajana aurton ke liye. Muttafaq alaih; Muslim ne izafa kiya: Namaz mein."
"175","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin Shikhkhir apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko namaz padhte dekha jabke Aap ke seene mein rone se deg ke josh jaisi awaz thi. Ise Khamsa ne Ibn Majah ke siwa riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"176","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath mere do dakhle the, to jab main Aap ke paas aata jabke Aap namaz padh rahe hote to mere liye gale se awaz nikalte. Ise Nasai aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."
"177","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Bilal se kaha: Tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kaise dekha ke woh unhen jawab dete jab woh Aap ko salam kehte jabke Aap namaz padh rahe hote? Unhon ne kaha: Aap aisa farmate, aur apni hatheli phailai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"178","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte jabke Aap Umamah bint Zainab ko uthae hue the, to jab sajda farmate use rakh dete aur jab khade hote use utha lete. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai ke Aap masjid mein logon ki imamat farma rahe the."
"179","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz mein do kalon ko qatl karo: saanp aur bichchu ko. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"180","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Juhaim bin Haris (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar namazi ke samne se guzarne wala janta ke us par kitna gunah hai to chalis [muddat] theharna us ke samne se guzarne se us ke liye behtar hota. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Bazzar mein doosri wajh se waqe hua: Chalis khareef [saal]."
"181","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Ghazwa Tabuk mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se namazi ke sutre ke bare mein poocha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: Kajri ke pichhle hisse jaisa ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"182","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sabrah bin Ma'bad Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni namaz mein sutra kare agarche teer se ho. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"183","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman aadmi ki namaz ko kaat deti hai jab us ke samne kajri ke pichhle hisse jaisa na ho: aurat, gadha aur siyah kutta... Al-hadees. Aur is mein hai: Siyah kutta shaitan hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke han Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi tarah hai kutte ke baghair; aur Abu Dawud aur Nasai ke han Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi tarah hai us ke aakhir ke baghair; aur aurat ko haiza se muqayyad kiya."
"184","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi kisi cheez ki taraf namaz padhe jo use logon se chhupae, phir koi us ke samne se guzarna chahe to use roke, phir agar woh inkar kare to us se lade, kyunke woh shaitan hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur ek riwayat mein hai: Kyunke us ke sath qareen hai."
"185","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz padhe to apne chehre ke samne koi cheez rakhe, phir agar na pae to lathi gade, phir agar na ho to lakeer khenche, phir jo us ke samne se guzre use nuqsan nahin dega. Ise Ahmad aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur jis ne gumaan kiya ke yeh muztarib hai us ne durust nahin kaha, balke yeh hasan hai."
"186","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz ko koi cheez nahin kaatti, aur jitna ho sake roko. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"187","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke aadmi mukhtasiran namaz padhe. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur is ka ma'na hai ke woh apna hath apni kamar par rakhe. Aur Bukhari mein Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se hai ke yeh un ki namaz mein Yahud ka fe'l hai."
"188","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab shaam ka khana pesh kiya jae to Maghrib padhne se pahle us se shuru karo. Muttafaq alaih."
"189","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein khada ho to kankariyon ko na chhue, kyunke rahmat us ke samne hoti hai. Ise Khamsa ne sahih sanad se riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad ne izafa kiya: Ek martaba ya chhor de. Aur Sahih mein Mu'aiqib se isi tarah hai baghair ta'leel ke."
"190","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se namaz mein idhar udhar dekhne ke bare mein poocha to Aap ne farmaya: Yeh uchak lena hai jo shaitan bande ki namaz se uchak leta hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi ke han Anas se hai aur unhon ne ise sahih kaha: Namaz mein idhar udhar dekhne se bacho, kyunke yeh halakat hai, phir agar zaroori ho to nafl mein ho."
"191","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein ho to woh apne Rabb se sargoshi karta hai, to apne samne ya dayen na thooke, lekin baen pair ke neeche thooke. Muttafaq alaih; aur ek riwayat mein hai: Ya apne pair ke neeche."
"192","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ke paas ek naqsh-dar parda tha jis se unhon ne apne ghar ka kinara dhanka tha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apna yeh parda ham se hata do, kyunke is ki tasweeren meri namaz mein mere samne aati rehti hain. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur donon Hazrat Aishah ki Abu Jahm ki chadar wali hadees par muttafiq hain, aur is mein hai: Kyunke is ne mujhe meri namaz se ghafil kar diya."
"193","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh qaum jo namaz mein apni aankhen aasman ki taraf uthate hain baaz aaen ya un ki taraf wapas na loten. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke han Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Khane ki maujudgi mein namaz nahin, aur na is haal mein ke use do napakiyan [peshab pakhana] rok rahi hon."
"194","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jamai shaitan se hai, to jab tum mein se koi jamai le to jitna ho sake roke. Ise Muslim aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne izafa kiya: Namaz mein."
"195","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mohallon mein masajid banane ka hukm diya, aur ke unhen saaf sutra aur khushbudar rakha jae. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur unhon ne is ke mursal hone ko sahih kaha."
"196","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Yahud ko halak kare: unhon ne apne nabiyon ki qabron ko masajid bana liya. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ne izafa kiya: Aur Nasara ko. Aur un donon ke han Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ki hadees se hai ke jab un mein koi nek aadmi marta to us ki qabr par masjid banate; aur is mein hai: Woh makhlooq mein sab se bure hain."
"197","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sawaron ka dasta bheja to woh ek aadmi ko le aae, to unhon ne use masjid ke sutunon mein se ek sutun se bandh diya. Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih."
"198","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ka guzar Hassan par hua jabke woh masjid mein she'r suna rahe the, to unhon ne un ki taraf dekha, to unhon ne kaha: Main to suna karta tha jabke is mein woh the jo tum se behtar the. Muttafaq alaih."
"199","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi aadmi ko masjid mein gumshuda cheez ka elan karte sune to kahe: Allah use tumhen na lotaye, kyunke masajid is liye nahin banain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"200","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum kisi ko masjid mein bechte ya khareedte dekho to kaho: Allah tumhari tijarat nafa bakhsh na kare. Ise Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"201","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Masajid mein hudud qaem na ki jaen aur na un mein qisas liya jae. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"202","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Khandaq ke din Sa'd zakhmi hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne masjid mein un ke liye khema lagaya taake qareeb se un ki iyadat karen. Muttafaq alaih."
"203","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap mujhe parda kar rahe the jabke main Habsha walon ko masjid mein khelte dekh rahi thi... Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih."
"204","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke ek siyah bachi thi jis ka masjid mein khema tha, to woh mere paas aati aur mere paas baat karti... Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih."
"205","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Masjid mein thookna gunah hai aur us ka kaffara use dafan karna hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"206","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke log masajid mein fakhr karen. Ise Khamsa ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"207","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe masajid ko buland o mazayyan banane ka hukm nahin diya gaya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"208","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke ajr mere samne pesh kiye gae, yahan tak ke woh tinka bhi jo aadmi masjid se nikalta hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise ghareeb kaha, aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"209","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi masjid mein dakhil ho to na baithe yahan tak ke do rak'aten padhe. Muttafaq alaih."
"210","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum namaz ke liye khade ho to wuzu poora karo, phir qibla ki taraf munh karo, phir takbir kaho, phir Quran mein se jo tumhen aasan ho padho, phir ruku karo yahan tak ke ruku mein itminan se raho, phir utho yahan tak ke khade seedhe ho jao, phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajde mein itminan se raho, phir utho yahan tak ke baithe itminan se raho, phir sajda karo yahan tak ke sajde mein itminan se raho, phir apni tamam namaz mein aisa karo. Ise Sab'a ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Ibn Majah ke han Muslim ki sanad se hai: Yahan tak ke khade itminan se raho. Aur isi tarah Ahmad aur Ibn Hibban ke han Rifa'ah ki hadees mein hai; aur Ahmad ke ek lafz mein hai: Apni peeth seedhi karo yahan tak ke haddiyan wapas aa jaen. Aur Nasai aur Abu Dawud ke han Rifa'ah bin Rafi' ki hadees se hai: Tum mein se kisi ki namaz poori na hogi yahan tak ke wuzu poora kare jaise Allah ne use hukm diya, phir Allah ki takbir kahe aur Us ki hamd aur sana kare. Aur is mein hai: Phir agar tumhare paas Quran ho to padho warna Allah ki hamd karo aur Us ki takbir aur tahlil kaho. Aur Abu Dawud ke han hai: Phir Umm al-Quran aur jo Allah chahe padho. Aur Ibn Hibban ke han hai: Phir jo chaho."
"211","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Humaid Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke jab takbir kehte to dono hath kandhon ke barabar rakhte, aur jab ruku farmate to dono hath ghutnon par jamate, phir peeth jhukate, phir jab sar uthate to seedhe ho jate yahan tak ke har jod apni jagah wapas aa jata, phir jab sajda farmate to dono hath rakhte na bichhate hue na samete hue, aur pairon ki unglion ke kinaron se qibla ki taraf munh karte, aur jab do rak'aton mein baithte to baen pair par baithte aur dayan khada rakhte, aur jab aakhri rak'at mein baithte to baen pair aage karte aur doosra khada rakhte aur sureen par baithte. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"212","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap jab namaz ke liye khade hote to farmate: Main ne apna chehra us ki taraf kiya jis ne aasmanon ko paida kiya... Yahan tak ke qaul: Musalmanon mein se, Aey Allah! Tu Badshah hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin, Tu mera Rabb hai aur main Tera banda hun... Aakhir tak. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai ke yeh raat ki namaz mein tha."
"213","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz ke liye takbir kehte to padhne se pahle thodi der khamosh rehte, to main ne poocha, to Aap ne farmaya: Main kehta hun: Aey Allah! Mere aur meri khaton ke darmiyan doori farma jaise Tu ne mashriq aur maghrib ke darmiyan doori farmai, Aey Allah! Mujhe meri khaton se pak farma jaise safed kapda mel se pak kiya jata hai, Aey Allah! Mujhe meri khaton se pani barf aur ole se dho de. Muttafaq alaih."
"214","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh kehte the: Tu pak hai Aey Allah apni hamd ke sath, Tera naam barkat wala hai, Teri azmat buland hai, aur Tere siwa koi mabud nahin. Ise Muslim ne munqati' sanad se riwayat kiya, aur Daraqutni ne mausul, aur yeh mauqoof hai; aur isi tarah Abu Sa'id se marfoo'an Khamsa ke han hai; aur is mein hai ke woh takbir ke baad kehte the: Main panah mangta hun Allah sunne wale janne wale ki shaitan mardud se, us ki deewangi, us ki phoonk aur us ki girha se."
"215","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz ka aaghaz takbir se farmate, aur qiraat alhamdu lillahi rabbil alameen se, aur jab ruku farmate to sar ko na uthae rakhte na jhukate, lekin darmiyan mein; aur jab ruku se uthte to sajda na farmate yahan tak ke khade seedhe ho jate; aur jab sajde se uthte to sajda na farmate yahan tak ke baithe seedhe ho jate; aur har do rak'aton mein tahiyyat kehte; aur baen pair bichhate aur dayan khada rakhte; aur shaitan ke uqbe [edon ke bal baithne] se mana farmate, aur mana farmate ke aadmi apne bazoo darinde ke bichhane ki tarah bichhae; aur namaz ka khatma salam se farmate. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya, aur is mein illat hai."
"216","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dono hath kandhon ke barabar uthate jab namaz shuru farmate, aur jab ruku ke liye takbir kehte, aur jab ruku se sar uthate. Muttafaq alaih; aur Abu Humaid ki hadees mein Abu Dawud ke han hai ke dono hath uthate yahan tak ke un se kandhon ke barabar karte, phir takbir kehte; aur Muslim ke han Malik bin Huwairis (Raziyallahu anhu) se Ibn Umar ki hadees jaisa hai, lekin unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke un se kanon ki lau ke barabar karte."
"217","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wa'il bin Hujr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi to Aap ne dayan hath baen hath par seene par rakha. Ise Ibn Khuzaimah ne riwayat kiya."
"218","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ki namaz nahin jis ne Umm al-Quran na padhi. Muttafaq alaih; aur Ibn Hibban aur Daraqutni ki ek riwayat mein hai: Woh namaz kafi nahin jis mein Fatihat al-Kitab na padhi jae. Aur doosri mein Ahmad, Abu Dawud, Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ke han hai: Shayad tum apne imam ke peeche padhte ho? Ham ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: Fatihat al-Kitab ke siwa aisa na karo, kyunke us ki namaz nahin jis ne use na padha."
"219","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar namaz ka aaghaz alhamdu lillahi rabbil alameen se farmate the. Muttafaq alaih; Muslim ne izafa kiya ke woh bismillahir rahmanir raheem ka zikr na karte awwal qiraat mein na aakhir mein. Aur Ahmad, Nasai aur Ibn Khuzaimah ki ek riwayat mein hai ke woh bismillahir rahmanir raheem buland awaz se na padhte the. Aur Ibn Khuzaimah ki doosri mein hai ke woh aahista padhte the. Aur isi par Muslim ki riwayat mein nafi ko mahmool kiya jata hai, us ke khilaf jis ne use ma'lul kaha."
"220","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'aim Mujammar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Abu Hurairah ke peeche namaz padhi to unhon ne bismillahir rahmanir raheem padhi, phir Umm al-Quran padhi, yahan tak ke jab walad-daalleen par pahunche to amin kaha, aur har sajde mein aur baithne se khade hote waqt Allahu akbar kehte, phir salam pherte waqt farmaya: Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, beshak main tum mein se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz se sab se ziyada mushabeh hun. Ise Nasai aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne riwayat kiya."
"221","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum Fatiha padho to bismillahir rahmanir raheem padho, kyunke yeh us ki aayaat mein se ek hai. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur unhon ne is ke mauqoof hone ko sahih kaha."
"222","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Umm al-Quran ki qiraat se farigh hote to awaz buland farmate aur amin kehte. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur ise hasan kaha, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ke han Wa'il bin Hujr ki hadees se isi tarah hai."
"223","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Awfa (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main Quran mein se kuch hasil nahin kar sakta, to mujhe woh sikhayen jo mujhe kafi ho. Aap ne farmaya: Subhanallah, walhamdu lillah, wa la ilaha illallah, wallahu akbar, wa la hawla wa la quwwata illa billahil aliyyil azeem... Al-hadees. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban, Daraqutni aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"224","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen namaz padhate, to Zuhr aur Asr mein pehli do rak'aton mein Fatihat al-Kitab aur do suraten padhte, aur kabhi hamen aayat sunate, aur pehli rak'at lambi farmate, aur aakhri do mein Fatihat al-Kitab padhte. Muttafaq alaih."
"225","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Zuhr aur Asr mein qiyam ka andaza lagate, to ham ne Zuhr ki pehli do rak'aton mein Aap ke qiyam ka andaza Alif Lam Meem Tanzeel Sajdah ke barabar lagaya; aur aakhri do mein us ka aadha; aur Asr ki pehli do mein Zuhr ki aakhri do ke barabar, aur Asr ki aakhri do Zuhr jaisi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"226","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke falan Zuhr ki pehli do lambi karta aur Asr halki karta, aur Maghrib mein chhoti Mufassal, aur Isha mein darmiyani aur Subah mein lambi padhta. To Hazrat Abu Hurairah ne farmaya: Main ne kisi ke peeche Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz se ziyada mushabeh namaz is se nahin padhi. Ise Nasai ne sahih sanad se riwayat kiya."
"227","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein Toor padhte suna. Muttafaq alaih."
"228","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Juma ke din Fajr ki namaz mein Alif Lam Meem Tanzeel Sajdah aur Hal ata alal insan padhte the. Muttafaq alaih; aur Tabarani ke han Ibn Mas'ud ki hadees se hai ke Aap ise hamesha farmate."
"229","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi to Aap ke paas rahmat ki koi aayat na guzarti magar us par thehar kar sawal farmate, aur na azab ki koi aayat magar us se panah mangte. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"230","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardar! Beshak mujhe mana kiya gaya hai ke main ruku ya sajde mein Quran padhun; to ruku mein Rabb ki azmat bayan karo, aur sajde mein dua mein koshish karo, to laeq hai ke tumhare liye qabool ki jae. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"231","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ruku aur sujood mein farmate: Tu pak hai Aey Allah Aey hamare Rabb apni hamd ke sath, Aey Allah mujhe bakhsh de. Muttafaq alaih."
"232","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz ke liye khade hote to khade hote waqt takbir kehte, phir ruku karte waqt takbir kehte, phir farmate: Allah ne sun liya jis ne Us ki hamd ki, jab ruku se peeth uthate, phir khade hote hue farmate: Aey hamare Rabb Tere hi liye hamd hai, phir sajde ko jhukte waqt takbir kehte, phir sar uthate waqt takbir kehte, phir sajda karte waqt takbir kehte, phir uthte waqt takbir kehte, phir poori namaz mein aisa farmate, aur do ke baad baithne se khade hote waqt takbir kehte. Muttafaq alaih."
"233","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ruku se sar uthate to farmate: Aey Allah Aey hamare Rabb Tere liye hamd hai aasmanon bhar aur zameen bhar aur us ke baad jo cheez Tu chahe us bhar, Aey sana aur buzurgi wale! Bande ka kaha hua sab se haq baat hai aur ham sab Tere bande hain: Aey Allah! Jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahin, aur jo Tu roke use koi dene wala nahin, aur kisi daulat wale ki daulat Tere samne nafa nahin degi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"234","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke saat haddiyon par sajda karun: peshani par aur Aap ne apne hath se naak ki taraf ishara kiya, aur dono hathon, dono ghutnon aur qadmon ke kinaron par. Muttafaq alaih."
"235","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Buhainah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab namaz padhte to dono hathon ke darmiyan kushadgi farmate yahan tak ke baghlon ki safedi zahir ho jati. Muttafaq alaih."
"236","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum sajda karo to apni hatheliyan rakho aur kuhniyan uthao. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wa'il bin Hujr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ruku farmate to unglion ke darmiyan kushadgi farmate aur jab sajda farmate to ungliyan milate. Ise Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"238","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko chaukdi mar kar namaz padhte dekha. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"239","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dono sajdon ke darmiyan farmate the: Aey Allah mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par raham farma, mujhe hidayat de, mujhe afiyat de aur mujhe rizq de. Ise Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur alfaz Abu Dawud ke hain, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"240","[AI-translation] Hazrat Malik bin Huwairis (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko namaz padhte dekha, to jab Aap apni namaz ke taaq [ek rak'at] mein hote to na uthte yahan tak ke baithe seedhe ho jate. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"241","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ruku ke baad ek mahina qunut ki, Arab ke kuch qabilon ke liye dua ya un par bad-dua farmate, phir chhor diya. Muttafaq alaih; aur Ahmad aur Daraqutni ke han doosri wajh se isi tarah hai aur izafa kiya: Lekin Subah mein Aap duniya se ruksat hone tak qunut farmate rahe."
"242","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qunut na farmate siwae is ke ke kisi qaum ke liye dua ya kisi qaum par bad-dua farmate. Ise Ibn Khuzaimah ne sahih kaha."
"243","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Tariq Ashja'i (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne apne walid se kaha: Aey abba! Aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar, Usman aur Ali ke peeche namaz padhi, kya woh Fajr mein qunut farmate the? Unhon ne kaha: Aey bete! Yeh nai cheez hai. Ise Khamsa ne Abu Dawud ke siwa riwayat kiya."
"244","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hasan bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kalimaat sikhaye jo main witr ke qunut mein kehta hun: Aey Allah mujhe hidayat de un mein jinhen Tu ne hidayat di, aur mujhe afiyat de un mein jinhen Tu ne afiyat di, aur mujhe dost bana un mein jinhen Tu ne dost banaya, aur mere liye barkat de us mein jo Tu ne diya, aur mujhe us ke sharr se bacha jo Tu ne muqaddar kiya, kyunke Tu faisla karta hai aur Tujh par faisla nahin kiya jata, beshak woh zaleel nahin hota jise Tu dost banae, Tu barkat wala hai Aey hamare Rabb aur buland hai. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya; aur Tabarani aur Baihaqi ne izafa kiya: Aur woh izzat nahin pata jis se Tu dushmani rakhe. Nasai ne doosri wajh se us ke aakhir mein izafa kiya: Aur Allah Nabi par salat bheje. Aur Baihaqi ke han Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen ek dua sikhate jo ham Subah ki namaz ke qunut mein mangte; aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"245","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi sajda kare to unt ki tarah na baithe, balke apne ghutnon se pahle apne hath rakhe. Ise Salasa ne riwayat kiya; aur yeh Wa'il (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees se qawi hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke jab sajda farmate to hathon se pahle ghutne rakhte. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya. Kyunke pehli ke liye Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees se shahid hai jise Ibn Khuzaimah ne sahih kaha, aur Bukhari ne ise ta'liqan mauqoof zikr kiya."
"246","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab tashahhud ke liye baithte to baen hath baen ghutne par rakhte aur dayan dayen par, aur tawan aur teppan ki girah lagate aur shahadat ki ungli se ishara farmate. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai ke tamam ungliyan band karte aur anguthe se mili hui [shahadat ki ungli] se ishara farmate."
"247","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamari taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz padhe to kahe: Tamam qaulil ibadaten Allah ke liye hain, aur namazen aur pakeezah cheezen; salam ho Aap par Aey Nabi aur Allah ki rahmat aur Us ki barkaten; salam ho ham par aur Allah ke nek bandon par; main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain; phir dua mein se jo use sab se pasand ho chun le aur dua kare. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Nasai ke han hai ke ham kehte the is se pahle ke ham par tashahhud farz hua; aur Ahmad ke han hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen tashahhud sikhaya aur hukm diya ke logon ko sikhayen; aur Muslim ke han Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se hai ke Rasulullah hamen tashahhud sikhate: Babarkat tahiyyat namazen Allah ke liye hain... Aakhir tak."
"248","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fudalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko apni namaz mein dua mangte suna, us ne Allah ki hamd na ki aur na Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par salat bheji, to Aap ne farmaya: Is ne jaldi ki. Phir use bulaya aur farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz padhe to apne Rabb ki hamd aur sana se shuru kare, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par salat bheje, phir jo chahe dua kare. Ise Ahmad aur Salasa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"249","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Bashir bin Sa'd ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Allah ne hamen hukm diya hai ke Aap par salat bhejen, to ham Aap par kaise salat bhejen? To Aap khamosh rahe, phir farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par salat bhej jaise Tu ne Aal Ibrahim par salat bheji, aur Muhammad par aur Muhammad ki aal par barkat bhej jaise Tu ne Aal Ibrahim par jahano mein barkat bheji, beshak Tu hamd wala buzurgi wala hai. Aur salam waise hai jaise tumhen sikhaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne is mein izafa kiya: To ham Aap par kaise salat bhejen jab ham apni namaz mein Aap par salat bhejen."
"250","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi tashahhud padhe to chaar cheezon se Allah ki panah mange, kahe: Aey Allah! Main Teri panah mangta hun jahannam ke azab se, aur qabr ke azab se, aur zindagi aur maut ke fitne se, aur Masih Dajjal ke fitne ke sharr se. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai: Jab tum mein se koi aakhri tashahhud se farigh ho."
"251","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Mujhe ek dua sikhayen jo main apni namaz mein mangun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah! Main ne apni jaan par bahut zulm kiya, aur gunahon ko Tere siwa koi nahin bakhshta, to mujhe apne paas se bakhshish ata farma, aur mujh par raham farma, beshak Tu hi bakhshne wala raham wala hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"252","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wa'il bin Hujr (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi to Aap dayan taraf salam pherte: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, aur baen taraf: Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah [wa barakatuh]. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kiya."
"253","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har farz namaz ke peeche farmate the: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin, Usi ki badshahat hai, Usi ki hamd hai, aur Woh har cheez par qadir hai; Aey Allah! Jo Tu de use koi rokne wala nahin, aur jo Tu roke use koi dene wala nahin, aur kisi daulat wale ki daulat Tere samne nafa nahin degi. Muttafaq alaih."
"254","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz ke peeche in se panah mangte the: Aey Allah! Main Teri panah mangta hun bukhl se, aur Teri panah mangta hun buzdili se, aur Teri panah mangta hun is se ke sab se zaleel umar ki taraf lotaya jaun, aur Teri panah mangta hun duniya ke fitne se, aur Teri panah mangta hun qabr ke azab se. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"255","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab apni namaz se phirte to teen martaba Allah se istighfar farmate aur kehte: Aey Allah Tu Salam hai aur Tujh hi se salamati hai, Tu barkat wala hai Aey jalal aur izzat wale. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"256","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke jo har namaz ke peeche tentis martaba Allah ki tasbih kare, aur tentis martaba Allah ki hamd kare, aur tentis martaba Allah ki takbir kahe, to yeh ninnanwe hue, aur sau poora karte hue kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin, Usi ki badshahat hai, Usi ki hamd hai, aur Woh har cheez par qadir hai, to us ki khatayen bakhsh di jati hain agarche samandar ki jhag jaisi hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur doosri riwayat mein hai ke takbir chauntis hai."
"257","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Aey Mu'az! Main tumhen wasiyat karta hun ke har namaz ke peeche yeh kehna na chhoro: Aey Allah meri madad farma Tere zikr, Tere shukr aur achchi ibadat par. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne qawi sanad se riwayat kiya."
"258","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo har farz namaz ke peeche Ayat al-Kursi padhe use jannat mein dakhil hone se siwae maut ke koi cheez nahin rokti. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur Tabarani ne is mein izafa kiya: Aur Qul huwallahu ahad."
"259","[AI-translation] Hazrat Malik bin Huwairis (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz padho jaise tum ne mujhe namaz padhte dekha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"260","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke mujh se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khade ho kar namaz padho, phir agar taqat na ho to baithe, phir agar taqat na ho to karwat par. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"261","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek beemar se farmaya jo takiye par namaz padh raha tha, to Aap ne use phenk diya aur farmaya: Zameen par namaz padho agar taqat ho, warna ishare se padho, aur apna sajda apne ruku se neeche rakho. Ise Baihaqi ne qawi sanad se riwayat kiya lekin Abu Hatim ne is ke mauqoof hone ko sahih kaha."
"262","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Buhainah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen Zuhr padhai, to pehli do rak'aton mein khade ho gae aur na baithe, to log Aap ke sath khade ho gae, yahan tak ke jab namaz poori ki aur log Aap ke salam ka intezar karne lage to baithte hue takbir kahi aur salam se pahle do sajde kiye, phir salam phera. Ise Sab'a ne riwayat kiya, aur yeh alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai ke har sajde mein takbir kehte hue baithte aur log Aap ke sath sajda karte baithne ke bhool ki jagah."
"263","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dopahar ki donon namazon mein se ek do rak'aten padhin, phir salam phera, phir masjid ke agle hisse mein ek lakdi ki taraf khade hue aur us par hath rakha, aur qaum mein Abu Bakr aur Umar the to unhen baat karne se haya aai, aur jaldi wale log nikal gae aur kahne lage: Kya namaz kam ho gayi! Aur ek aadmi tha jise Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zul-Yadain kehte the, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Aap bhool gae ya namaz kam ho gayi? Aap ne farmaya: Na main bhoola na kam hui. Us ne kaha: Kyun nahin, Aap bhool gae hain, to Aap ne do rak'aten padhin phir salam phera, phir takbir kahi aur apne sajde jaisa ya us se lamba sajda kiya, phir sar uthaya aur takbir kahi, phir sar rakha aur takbir kahi aur apne sajde jaisa ya us se lamba sajda kiya, phir sar uthaya aur takbir kahi. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai ke Asr ki namaz thi; aur Abu Dawud ke han hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Kya Zul-Yadain sach kehta hai? To unhon ne ishara kiya: Yani han. Aur yeh Sahihain mein hai lekin lafz se: To unhon ne kaha. Aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai ke Aap ne sajda na kiya yahan tak ke Allah Ta'ala ne Aap ko us ka yaqeen dila diya."
"264","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen namaz padhai to bhool gae, phir do sajde kiye, phir tashahhud padha, phir salam phera. Ise Abu Dawud, Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"265","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein shak kare aur na jane ke kitni padhi teen ya chaar? To shak ko door kare aur yaqeen par bina kare, phir salam se pahle do sajde kare; phir agar paanch padhi to woh us ki namaz ko jod dengi, aur agar poori padhi to dono shaitan ke liye zillat hongi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"266","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, phir jab salam phera to Aap se kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Kya namaz mein koi nai cheez hui? Aap ne farmaya: Woh kya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne itni padhi. To Aap ne dono pair mode aur qibla ki taraf munh kiya aur do sajde kiye, phir salam phera, phir hamari taraf mutawajjah hue aur farmaya: Beshak agar namaz mein koi nai cheez hoti to main tumhen batata, lekin main to bashar hun bhoolta hun jaise tum bhoolte ho, to jab main bhoolun to mujhe yaad dilao, aur jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein shak kare to durust ko talash kare aur us par poora kare, phir do sajde kare. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ki ek riwayat mein hai: To poora kare, phir salam phere, phir sajda kare. Aur Muslim ke han hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sahw ke do sajde salam aur kalam ke baad kiye. Aur Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ke han Abdullah bin Ja'far ki hadees se marfoo'an hai: Jo apni namaz mein shak kare woh salam ke baad do sajde kare. Aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"267","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi shak kare aur dono rak'aton mein khada ho jae, phir khada poora ho jae to aage badhe aur do sajde kare, aur agar khada poora na hua ho to baithe aur us par sahw nahin. Ise Abu Dawud, Ibn Majah aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur alfaz Daraqutni ke hain za'if sanad ke sath."
"268","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo imam ke peeche ho us par sahw nahin, phir agar imam bhoole to us par aur jo us ke peeche hon un par [sahw hai]. Ise Bazzar aur Baihaqi ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"269","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har sahw ke liye salam ke baad do sajde hain. Ise Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"270","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Izas-sama'un-shaqqat aur Iqra bismi rabbika mein sajda kiya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"271","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Sad pakke sajdon mein se nahin, aur main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is mein sajda karte dekha hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"272","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Najm mein sajda kiya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"273","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Najm padh kar sunai to Aap ne is mein sajda na kiya. Muttafaq alaih."
"274","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khalid bin Ma'dan (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Surah Hajj ko do sajdon se fazilat di gayi. Ise Abu Dawud ne Maraseel mein riwayat kiya; aur Ahmad aur Tirmidhi ne ise Uqbah bin Amir ki hadees se mausul riwayat kiya aur izafa kiya: Jo in donon ka sajda na kare woh use na padhe. Aur is ki sanad za'if hai."
"275","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Aey logo! Beshak ham sajde se guzarte hain, to jo sajda kare us ne durust kiya, aur jo sajda na kare us par gunah nahin. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur is mein hai ke Allah Ta'ala ne sajda farz nahin kiya siwae is ke ke ham chahen; aur yeh Muwatta mein hai."
"276","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen Quran padh kar sunate, phir jab sajde se guzarte to takbir kehte aur sajda farmate aur ham Aap ke sath sajda karte. Ise Abu Dawud ne aisi sanad se riwayat kiya jis mein narmi hai."
"277","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab koi khush karne wali baat aati to Allah ke liye sajde mein gir jate. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya."
"278","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Awf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sajda kiya aur sajda lamba kiya, phir sar uthaya aur farmaya: Beshak Jibrail mere paas aae aur mujhe khushkhabri di, to main ne Allah ke liye shukr ka sajda kiya. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"279","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ali ko Yaman bheja phir hadees zikr ki, unhon ne kaha: To Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un ke Islam lane ke bare mein likha, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khat padha to sajde mein gir gae. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Bukhari mein hai."
"280","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi'ah bin Ka'b Aslami (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mujh se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mango. To main ne kaha: Main Aap se jannat mein Aap ki rifaqat mangta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Is ke siwa kuch aur? Main ne kaha: Yahi hai. Aap ne farmaya: To kasrat sajda se apne nafs par meri madad karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"281","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se das rak'aten yaad kin: Zuhr se pahle do rak'aten, aur us ke baad do, aur Maghrib ke baad do apne ghar mein, aur Isha ke baad do apne ghar mein, aur Subah se pahle do. Muttafaq alaih; aur un donon ki ek riwayat mein hai ke Juma ke baad apne ghar mein do rak'aten; aur Muslim ke han hai ke jab Fajr tulu' hoti to siwae do halki rak'aton ke na padhte."
"282","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr se pahle chaar aur Subah se pahle do na chhorte the. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"283","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nawafil mein se kisi cheez ki Fajr ki do rak'aton se ziyada pabandi na farmate the. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai: Fajr ki do rak'aten duniya aur jo us mein hai us se behtar hain."
"284","[AI-translation] Umm al-Mu'minin Hazrat Umm Habibah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo din raat mein barah rak'aten padhe un se us ke liye jannat mein ghar banaya jata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur ek riwayat mein hai: Nafl ke taur par. Aur Tirmidhi ke han isi tarah hai aur izafa kiya: Zuhr se pahle chaar aur us ke baad do, aur Maghrib ke baad do, aur Isha ke baad do, aur Fajr ki namaz se pahle do. Aur Khamsa ke han unhi se hai: Jo Zuhr se pahle chaar aur us ke baad chaar ki hifazat kare Allah use aag par haram kar deta hai."
"285","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us shakhs par raham kare jo Asr se pahle chaar padhe. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha, aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"286","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal Muzani (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Maghrib se pahle padho, Maghrib se pahle padho, phir teesri martaba farmaya: Jo chahe, is napasandidgi se ke log use sunnat bana len. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Ibn Hibban ki riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Maghrib se pahle do rak'aten padhin; aur Muslim ke han Anas se hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham suraj doobne ke baad do rak'aten padhte the, to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen dekhte, na hamen hukm dete na mana farmate."
"287","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Subah ki namaz se pahle ki do rak'aten halki padhte yahan tak ke main kehti: Kya Aap ne Umm al-Kitab padhi? Muttafaq alaih."
"288","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fajr ki do rak'aton mein Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun aur Qul huwallahu ahad padhi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"289","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Fajr ki do rak'aten padhte to dayan karwat let-te. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"290","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Subah ki namaz se pahle ki do rak'aten padhe to dayan karwat lete. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"291","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat ki namaz do do hai, phir jab tum mein se koi Subah ka khauf kare to ek rak'at padhe jo us ne padhi use taaq bana degi. Muttafaq alaih; aur Khamsa ke han aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha: Din raat ki namaz do do hai. Aur Nasai ne kaha: Yeh khata hai."
"292","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farz ke baad afzal namaz raat ki namaz hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"293","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Ayyub Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Witr har Musalman par haq hai, jo paanch se witr karna chahe woh kare, aur jo teen se witr karna chahe woh kare, aur jo ek se witr karna chahe woh kare. Ise Arba'a ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha, aur Nasai ne is ke mauqoof hone ko tarjeeh di."
"294","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke witr farz ki tarah lazim nahin, lekin sunnat hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sunnat ki. Ise Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"295","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramazan ke mahine mein khade hue, phir agle saal unhon ne intezar kiya to Aap bahar na aae, aur farmaya: Beshak mujhe khauf hua ke tum par witr likh diya jaega. Ise Ibn Hibban ne riwayat kiya."
"296","[AI-translation] Hazrat Kharijah bin Huzafah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tumhen ek namaz se madad di hai jo tumhare liye surkh unton se behtar hai. Ham ne kaha: Woh kya hai Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Witr, Isha ki namaz se tulu' fajr tak. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Ahmad ne Amr bin Shu'aib se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se isi tarah riwayat kiya."
"297","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraidah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Witr haq hai, to jo witr na padhe woh ham mein se nahin. Ise Abu Dawud ne narm sanad se riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ka ek za'if shahid Ahmad ke han Abu Hurairah se hai."
"298","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ramazan mein na us ke siwa gyarah rak'aton se ziyada padhte: chaar padhte, to un ke husn aur tool ke bare mein na poocho, phir chaar padhte, to un ke husn aur tool ke bare mein na poocho, phir teen padhte. Hazrat Aishah ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Aap witr se pahle sote hain? Aap ne farmaya: Aey Aishah! Meri aankhen soti hain aur mera dil nahin sota. Muttafaq alaih; aur un donon ki ek riwayat mein unhi se hai ke Aap raat mein das rak'aten padhte aur ek sajde [rak'at] se witr farmate aur Fajr ki do rak'aten padhte, to yeh terah huin."
"299","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat mein terah rak'aten padhte, un mein se paanch se witr farmate, kisi mein na baithte siwae aakhir mein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"300","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne poori raat mein witr padha, aur Aap ka witr sahar tak pahuncha. Muttafaq alaih."
"301","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Abdullah! Falan ki tarah na ho jao, woh raat mein qiyam karta tha phir raat ka qiyam chhor diya. Muttafaq alaih."
"302","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Witr padho Aey Ahle Quran, kyunke Allah taaq hai aur taaq ko pasand karta hai. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"303","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Raat mein apni aakhri namaz witr banao. Muttafaq alaih."
"304","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talq bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ek raat mein do witr nahin. Ise Ahmad aur Salasa ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"305","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Sabbahisma rabbikal a'la, Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun aur Qul huwallahu ahad se witr farmate the. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya; aur izafa kiya ke siwae aakhir mein salam na pherte; aur Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ke han Aishah se isi tarah hai aur is mein hai ke har surat ek rak'at mein, aur aakhri mein Qul huwallahu ahad aur Mu'awwizatain."
"306","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Subah hone se pahle witr padho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Ibn Hibban ke han hai: Jo subah ko pa le aur witr na padha ho to us ke liye witr nahin."
"307","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo witr se so jae ya bhool jae to subah hone par ya yaad aane par padhe. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya."
"308","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khauf kare ke raat ke aakhir mein na uth sakega to awwal mein witr padhe, aur jo ummeed rakhe ke aakhir mein uthega to raat ke aakhir mein witr padhe, kyunke raat ke aakhir ki namaz hazir ki jati hai, aur yahi afzal hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"309","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab Fajr tulu' ho jae to raat ki har namaz aur witr chale gae, to tulu' fajr se pahle witr padho. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya."
"310","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Chasht ki chaar padhte aur jitna Allah chahta ziyada farmate. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke han unhi se hai ke un se poocha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Chasht padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, siwae is ke ke safar se aate. Aur unhi ke han unhi se hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Chasht ki nafl padhte kabhi nahin dekha, halanke main use padhti hun."
"311","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Awwabeen ki namaz jab unt ke bachche garmi se jalne lagen [hai]. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya."
"312","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Chasht ki barah rak'aten padhe Allah us ke liye jannat mein mahal banata hai. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise ghareeb kaha."
"313","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere ghar mein aae aur Chasht ki aath rak'aten padhin. Ise Ibn Hibban ne apne Sahih mein riwayat kiya."
"314","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jama'at ki namaz akele ki namaz se sattais darje afzal hai. Muttafaq alaih; aur un donon ke han Abu Hurairah se hai: Pachees hisse se. Aur isi tarah Bukhari ke han Abu Sa'id se hai aur kaha: Darja se."
"315","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, main ne irada kiya ke lakdiyon ka hukm dun to lakdiyan jama ki jaen, phir namaz ka hukm dun to us ke liye azan di jae, phir ek aadmi ko hukm dun jo logon ko namaz padhae, phir un aadmiyon ki taraf jaun jo namaz mein hazir nahin hote aur un par un ke ghar jala dun; aur us ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, agar un mein se koi janta ke woh mota gosht wala haddi ya do achche khur wala paega to Isha mein zaroor hazir hota. Muttafaq alaih aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"316","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munafiqon par sab se bhari namaz Isha ki namaz aur Fajr ki namaz hai, aur agar woh jante jo un donon mein hai to un donon mein aate agarche ghutnon ke bal. Muttafaq alaih."
"317","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ek nabina aadmi aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mera koi le jane wala nahin jo mujhe masjid tak le jae, to Aap ne use ruksat di; phir jab woh wapas gaya to use bulaya aur farmaya: Kya tum namaz ki nida sunte ho? Us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: To jawab do. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"318","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo nida sune aur na aae to us ki namaz nahin siwae uzr ke. Ise Ibn Majah, Daraqutni, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad Muslim ki shart par hai, lekin ba'z ne is ke mauqoof hone ko tarjeeh di."
"319","[AI-translation] Hazrat Yazid bin Aswad (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Subah ki namaz padhi; phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi to Aap ne do aadmiyon ko dekha jinhon ne namaz na padhi thi, to Aap ne unhen bulaya aur woh lae gae jabke un ki pasliyan kaanp rahi thin; to Aap ne un se farmaya: Tumhen hamare sath namaz padhne se kis ne roka? Unhon ne kaha: Ham ne apne gharon mein padh li thi. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo; jab tum apne gharon mein padh lo phir imam ko pao aur us ne na padhi ho to us ke sath padho, kyunke woh tumhare liye nafl hogi. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz unhi ke hain, aur Salasa ne; aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"320","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imam is liye banaya gaya hai ke us ki iqtida ki jae; to jab woh takbir kahe to takbir kaho aur us waqt tak takbir na kaho jab tak woh takbir na kahe; aur jab woh ruku kare to ruku karo aur us waqt tak ruku na karo jab tak woh ruku na kare; aur jab woh kahe sami'allahu liman hamidah to kaho allahumma rabbana lakal hamd; aur jab woh sajda kare to sajda karo aur us waqt tak sajda na karo jab tak woh sajda na kare; aur jab woh khade ho kar padhe to khade ho kar padho, aur jab woh baithe padhe to sab baithe padho. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur yeh unhi ke alfaz hain; aur is ki asl Sahihain mein hai."
"321","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba mein peeche rehna dekha to farmaya: Aage badho aur meri iqtida karo, aur jo tumhare baad hon woh tumhari iqtida karen. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"322","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chatai se ek hujra banaya aur us mein namaz padhi; to kuch aadmi Aap tak pahunche aur Aap ki namaz se namaz padhne aae... Al-hadees; aur is mein hai: Aadmi ki afzal namaz apne ghar mein hai siwae farz ke. Muttafaq alaih."
"323","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Mu'az ne apne sahaba ko Isha padhai aur un par lambi ki, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Mu'az! Kya tum fitna dalne wale banna chahte ho? Jab tum logon ki imamat karo to Wash-shamsi wa duhaha, Sabbihisma rabbikal a'la, Iqra bismi rabbika aur Wal-laili iza yaghsha se padho. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"324","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki logon ko namaz padhane ke qisse mein jabke Aap beemar the riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: To Aap aae yahan tak ke Abu Bakr ke baen baithe; to Aap logon ko baithe namaz padhate jabke Abu Bakr khade the; Abu Bakr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ki iqtida karte aur log Abu Bakr ki namaz ki iqtida karte. Muttafaq alaih."
"325","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi logon ki imamat kare to halki kare, kyunke un mein chhota, bada, kamzor aur hajat wala hai; phir jab akele padhe to jaise chahe padhe. Muttafaq alaih."
"326","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Salamah se riwayat hai ke mere walid ne kaha: Main tumhare paas Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se haq ke sath aaya hun. Aap ne farmaya: Phir jab namaz aa jae to tum mein se koi azan de aur tumhen woh imamat karae jo tum mein sab se ziyada Quran wala ho. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne dekha aur mujh se ziyada Quran wala koi na tha, to unhon ne mujhe aage kiya jabke main chhe ya saat saal ka tha. Ise Bukhari, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"327","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qaum ki imamat woh karae jo un mein Allah ki kitab ka sab se bada qari ho; phir agar qiraat mein barabar hon to jo un mein sunnat ka sab se bada alim ho; phir agar sunnat mein barabar hon to jo hijrat mein sab se aqdam ho; phir agar hijrat mein barabar hon to jo islam mein sab se aqdam ho, aur ek riwayat mein hai: umar mein; aur koi aadmi kisi aadmi ki us ki saltanat mein imamat na karae, aur na us ke ghar mein us ki izzat ki jagah par baithe siwae us ki ijazat ke. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"328","[AI-translation] Aur Ibn Majah ke han Jabir ki hadees se hai: Na aurat mard ki imamat karae, na dehati muhajir ki, na fajir mu'min ki. Aur is ki sanad kamzor hai."
"329","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Apni safen milao, un ke darmiyan qareeb karo aur gardanon se barabar karo. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"330","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mardon ki behtareen safen pehli hain aur badtareen aakhri; aur aurton ki behtareen safen aakhri hain aur badtareen pehli. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"331","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek raat namaz padhi to main Aap ke baen khada hua; to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne peeche se mera sar pakda aur mujhe apne dayen kar diya. Muttafaq alaih."
"332","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi to main aur ek yateem Aap ke peeche khade hue aur Umm Sulaim hamare peeche. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"333","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahunche jabke Aap ruku mein the, to saf tak pahunchne se pahle ruku kiya; to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Allah tumhara hirs badhae, aur dobara aisa na karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ne is mein izafa kiya ke saf se pahle ruku kiya phir saf tak chale."
"334","[AI-translation] Hazrat Wabisah bin Ma'bad Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko saf ke peeche akele namaz padhte dekha to use namaz dohrane ka hukm diya. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur unhi ke han Talq se hai: Saf ke peeche akele ki namaz nahin. Aur Tabarani ne Wabisah ki hadees se izafa kiya: Kya tum un mein dakhil na hue ya kisi aadmi ko kheench na liya?"
"335","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum iqamat suno to namaz ki taraf chalo jabke tum par sukoon aur waqar ho, aur tez na chalo; to jo pao padho aur jo choot jae poora karo. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"336","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ki namaz ek aadmi ke sath us ki akele namaz se ziyada pakeezah hai, aur do aadmiyon ke sath us ki namaz ek aadmi ke sath us ki namaz se ziyada pakeezah hai; aur jitni ziyada ho woh Allah Azza wa Jalla ko ziyada mahboob hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"337","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Waraqah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke apne ghar walon ki imamat karen. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"338","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ibn Umm Maktum ko khalifa banaya jo logon ki imamat karte jabke woh nabina the. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur isi tarah Ibn Hibban ke han Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se hai."
"339","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us par namaz padho jo La ilaha illallah kahe, aur us ke peeche padho jo La ilaha illallah kahe. Ise Daraqutni ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"340","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz mein aae jabke imam kisi haal par ho to waisa kare jaisa imam karta hai. Ise Tirmidhi ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"341","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke sab se pahle namaz do rak'aten farz hui, phir safar ki namaz baqi rakhi gayi aur hazar ki namaz poori ki gayi. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ke han hai: Phir hijrat ki to chaar farz huin aur safar ki namaz awwal par baqi rakhi gayi. Ahmad ne izafa kiya: Siwae Maghrib ke kyunke woh din ka witr hai, aur siwae Subah ke kyunke us mein qiraat lambi hoti hai."
"342","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein qasr farmate aur poori bhi, aur roza rakhte aur iftar bhi karte. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur is ke rawi siqah hain; magar yeh ma'lul hai; aur mahfooz Aishah se un ke fe'l se hai, aur unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mashaqqat nahin hoti. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya."
"343","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah pasand karta hai ke Us ki ruksaton par amal kiya jae jaise napasand karta hai ke Us ki nafarmani ki jae. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur ek riwayat mein hai: Jaise pasand karta hai ke Us ke azaem par amal kiya jae."
"344","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab teen meel ya farsakh ki musafat nikalte to do rak'aten padhte. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"345","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Madinah se Makkah nikle to Aap do do rak'aten padhte yahan tak ke ham Madinah wapas aae. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"346","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unnis din qasr kiya; aur ek lafz mein hai: Makkah mein unnis din. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ki ek riwayat mein hai: Satrah; aur doosri mein: Pandrah; aur unhi ke han Imran bin Husain se hai: Attharah; aur unhi ke han Jabir se hai: Tabuk mein bees din qasr farmate rahe; aur is ke rawi siqah hain magar is ke mausul hone mein ikhtilaf hua."
"347","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab suraj dhalne se pahle kooch farmate to Zuhr ko Asr ke waqt tak moakhar farmate, phir utarte aur donon ko jama farmate; phir agar suraj kooch se pahle dhal jata to Zuhr padhte phir sawar hote. Muttafaq alaih; aur Hakim ki Arba'in mein sahih sanad se riwayat mein hai ke Zuhr aur Asr padhi phir sawar hue; aur Abu Nu'aim ke Mustakhraj Muslim mein hai ke jab safar mein hote aur suraj dhal jata to Zuhr aur Asr dono padhte phir kooch farmate."
"348","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ghazwa Tabuk mein nikle to Aap Zuhr aur Asr dono padhte aur Maghrib aur Isha dono padhte. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"349","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaar burd se kam mein namaz qasr na karo, Makkah se Usfan tak. Ise Daraqutni ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya aur sahih hai ke yeh mauqoof hai, isi tarah Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise nikala."
"350","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke behtareen woh hain jo jab bura karen istighfar karen, aur jab safar karen qasr karen aur iftar karen. Ise Tabarani ne Awsat mein za'if sanad se riwayat kiya; aur yeh Baihaqi ke han Sa'id bin Musayyab ke mursal mein mukhtasar hai."
"351","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke mujhe bawaseer thi to main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se namaz ke bare mein poocha? To Aap ne farmaya: Khade ho kar padho, phir agar taqat na ho to baithe, phir agar taqat na ho to karwat par. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"352","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek beemar ki iyadat ki to use takiye par namaz padhte dekha, to use phenk diya aur farmaya: Zameen par padho agar taqat ho, warna ishare se padho, aur apna sajda apne ruku se neeche rakho. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Hatim ne is ke mauqoof hone ko sahih kaha."
"353","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko chaukdi mar kar namaz padhte dekha. Ise Nasai ne riwayat kiya; aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"354","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar aur Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhum) se riwayat hai ke un donon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne mimbar ki lakdiyon par farmate suna: Log Jumaon ko chhorne se baaz aaen ya Allah un ke dilon par muhar laga dega, phir woh ghafilon mein se ho jaenge. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"355","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salamah bin Akwa' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Juma padhte, phir wapas jate jabke deewaron ka koi saya na hota jis mein saya hasil karen. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Muslim ke ek lafz mein hai ke ham Aap ke sath juma padhte jab suraj dhal jata, phir wapas jate saya talash karte."
"356","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ham qailula na karte aur na dopahar ka khana khate siwae Juma ke baad. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur ek riwayat mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein."
"357","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade khutba de rahe the, to Sham se ek tijarti qafila aaya, to log us ki taraf phir gae yahan tak ke barah aadmi ke siwa koi na bacha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"358","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Juma ki namaz ki ya ghair ki ek rak'at pa le to us se doosri milae, aur us ki namaz poori ho gayi. Ise Nasai, Ibn Majah aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur alfaz Daraqutni ke hain, aur is ki sanad sahih hai, lekin Abu Hatim ne is ke mursal hone ko qawi kaha."
"359","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade khutba dete, phir baithte, phir khade hote aur khade khutba dete; to jo tumhen khabar de ke Aap baithe khutba dete the us ne jhoot kaha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"360","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab khutba dete to Aap ki aankhen surkh ho jatin, awaz buland ho jati aur gussa shadeed ho jata, yahan tak ke goya Aap lashkar se darane wale hon farmate: Subah sham tum par hamla; aur farmate: Amma ba'd! Beshak behtareen baat Allah ki kitab hai, aur behtareen hidayat Muhammad ki hidayat hai, aur badtareen umoor nae ijaad karda hain, aur har bid'at gumrahi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka Juma ke din khutba tha ke Allah ki hamd aur sana farmate, phir us ke baad farmate jabke awaz buland hoti; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai: Jise Allah hidayat de use koi gumrah karne wala nahin, aur jise woh gumrah kare use koi hidayat dene wala nahin. Aur Nasai ke han hai: Aur har gumrahi aag mein hai."
"361","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Beshak aadmi ki namaz ka lamba hona aur us ke khutbe ka chhota hona us ke faqeeh hone ki nishani hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"362","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Hisham bint Harisah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne Qaf wal-Quranil Majeed siwae Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban se na li, Aap use har Juma mimbar par padhte jab logon ko khutba dete. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"363","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Juma ke din baat kare jabke imam khutba de raha ho woh us gadhe ki tarah hai jo kitaben uthae hue hai, aur jo us se kahe: Khamosh raho, us ke liye Juma nahin. Ise Ahmad ne aisi sanad se riwayat kiya jis mein harj nahin; aur yeh Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki Sahihain mein marfoo' hadees ki tafseer karti hai ke jab tum ne apne sathi se kaha: Khamosh raho, Juma ke din jabke imam khutba de raha ho, to tum ne laghw kiya."
"364","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Juma ke din dakhil hua jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba de rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne namaz padhi? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Khade ho aur do rak'aten padho. Muttafaq alaih."
"365","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Juma ki namaz mein Surah Juma aur Munafiqun padhte the. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke han Nu'man bin Bashir se hai ke Aap dono Eidon mein aur Juma mein Sabbahisma rabbikal a'la aur Hal ataka hadeesul ghashiyah padhte the."
"366","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Eid padhai, phir Juma mein ruksat di aur farmaya: Jo chahe padhe woh padhe. Ise Khamsa ne Tirmidhi ke siwa riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah ne ise sahih kaha."
"367","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi Juma padhe to us ke baad chaar padhe. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"368","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'ib bin Yazid se riwayat hai ke Mu'awiyah ne un se kaha: Jab tum Juma padho to use kisi namaz se na milao yahan tak ke baat karo ya niklo, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen is ka hukm diya ke ham ek namaz ko doosri se na milayen yahan tak ke baat karen ya niklen. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"369","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghusl kare, phir Juma mein aae, phir jitni us ke liye muqaddar ki gayi padhe, phir khamosh rahe yahan tak ke imam apne khutbe se farigh ho, phir us ke sath padhe to us ke darmiyan aur doosre Juma ke darmiyan bakhsh diya jata hai aur teen din ka izafa. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"370","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Juma ke din ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Is mein ek ghadi hai jo bhi Musalman banda us mein khade namaz padhte hue Allah Azza wa Jalla se koi cheez mange use ata ki jati hai, aur Aap ne apne hath se ishara kiya ke use kam karne wale hain. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai: Aur woh halki ghadi hai."
"371","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Burdah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Woh imam ke baithne se namaz poori hone tak ke darmiyan hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya, aur Daraqutni ne tarjeeh di ke yeh Abu Burdah ka qaul hai; aur Ibn Majah ke han Abdullah bin Salam ki hadees mein, aur Abu Dawud aur Nasai ke han Jabir ki hadees mein hai ke woh Asr ki namaz se suraj doobne tak ke darmiyan hai. Aur is mein chalis se ziyada aqwal par ikhtilaf hua hai jo main ne Sharh Bukhari mein likhe hain."
"372","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke sunnat guzar chuki hai ke har chalis aur us se upar mein Juma hai. Ise Daraqutni ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"373","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har Juma mu'min mardon aur mu'min aurton ke liye istighfar farmate the. Ise Bazzar ne narm sanad se riwayat kiya."
"374","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutbe mein Quran ki aayaat padhte aur logon ko nasihat farmate. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Muslim mein hai."
"375","[AI-translation] Hazrat Tariq bin Shihab se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Juma haq wajib hai har Musalman par jama'at mein siwae chaar ke: ghulam, aurat, bachcha aur beemar. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur kaha ke Tariq ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se nahin suna; aur Hakim ne ise mazkoor Tariq se Abu Musa ki riwayat se nikala."
"376","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musafir par Juma nahin. Ise Tabarani ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"377","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab mimbar par seedhe hote to ham apne chehron se Aap ki taraf mutawajjah hote. Ise Tirmidhi ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya; aur is ka ek shahid Ibn Khuzaimah ke han Bara ki hadees se hai."
"378","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakam bin Hazn (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Juma mein hazri di to Aap lathi ya kaman par tek lagaye khade hue. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"379","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salih bin Khawwat se, us se jis ne Zat ar-Riqa' ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Salat al-Khawf padhi, riwayat hai ke ek giroh ne Aap ke sath padhi aur ek giroh dushman ke samne tha, to Aap ne un ke sath jo Aap ke paas the ek rak'at padhi, phir khade thehre aur unhon ne apne liye poori ki, phir wapas gae aur dushman ke samne saf bandhi, aur doosra giroh aaya to Aap ne unhen baqi rak'at padhai, phir baithe thehre aur unhon ne apne liye poori ki, phir Aap ne unhen salam phera. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"380","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Najd ki taraf ghazwa kiya, to ham dushman ke samne hue aur ham ne safen bandhin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen namaz padhane khade hue, to ek giroh Aap ke sath khada hua aur ek giroh dushman ki taraf mutawajjah hua, aur Aap ne un ke sath ruku kiya jo Aap ke sath the aur do sajde kiye, phir wapas gae us giroh ki jagah jis ne namaz na padhi thi, to woh aae aur Aap ne unhen ek rak'at padhai aur do sajde kiye, phir salam phera, phir un mein se har ek khada hua aur apne liye ek rak'at ruku ki aur do sajde kiye. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"381","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Salat al-Khawf mein hazri di, to Aap ne hamen do safen banain: ek saf Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche jabke dushman hamare aur qibla ke darmiyan tha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne takbir kahi aur ham sab ne takbir kahi, phir ruku kiya aur ham sab ne ruku kiya, phir ruku se sar uthaya aur ham sab ne uthaya, phir sajde ko jhuke aur woh saf jo Aap se mili hui thi, aur pichhli saf dushman ke samne khadi rahi; phir jab sajda poora kiya to woh saf jo mili hui thi khadi hui aur us ne bhi sajda kiya, phir pehli saf peeche hati aur doosri saf aage badhi; phir Aap ne salam phera aur ham sab ne salam phera. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"382","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne inhen ek rak'at aur inhen ek rak'at Salat al-Khawf padhai, aur unhon ne qaza na ki. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur isi tarah Ibn Khuzaimah ke han Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se hai."
"383","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Salat al-Khawf ek rak'at hai kisi bhi wajh se ho. Ise Bazzar ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"384","[AI-translation] Unhin se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Salat al-Khawf mein sahw nahin. Ise Daraqutni ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"385","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitr us din hai jis din log iftar karen, aur Azha us din hai jis din log qurbani karen. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya."
"386","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umair bin Anas apne chachaon se jo sahaba mein se the riwayat karte hain ke ek sawar giroh aaya aur unhon ne gawahi di ke unhon ne kal chand dekha tha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke iftar karen, aur jab subah ho to apni eidgah ki taraf subah sawere jaen. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur yeh unhi ke alfaz hain, aur is ki sanad sahih hai."
"387","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fitr ke din subah na nikalte yahan tak ke khajuren kha lete. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur ek mu'allaq riwayat mein hai jise Ahmad ne mausul kiya ke unhen taaq khate."
"388","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Buraidah apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fitr ke din bahar na nikalte yahan tak ke kha lete, aur Azha ke din na khate yahan tak ke namaz padh lete. Ise Ahmad aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"389","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke hamen hukm diya gaya ke kunwari ladkiyon aur haiza aurton ko dono Eidon mein nikalen; woh khair aur Musalmanon ki dua mein hazir hon, aur haiza aurtain eidgah se alag rahen. Muttafaq alaih."
"390","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar dono Eidein khutbe se pahle padhte the. Muttafaq alaih."
"391","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Eid ke din do rak'aten padhin, na us se pahle padhin na us ke baad. Ise Sab'a ne riwayat kiya."
"392","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Eid baghair azan aur iqamat ke padhi. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Bukhari mein hai."
"393","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eid se pahle kuch na padhte, phir jab apne ghar wapas aate to do rak'aten padhte. Ise Ibn Majah ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"394","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fitr aur Azha ke din eidgah ki taraf nikalte, aur sab se pahle namaz se shuru farmate, phir wapas hote aur logon ke samne khade hote jabke log apni safon par hote, to unhen nasihat farmate aur hukm dete. Muttafaq alaih."
"395","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Nabiullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitr mein takbir pehli mein saat aur doosri mein paanch hai, aur qiraat un donon ke baad hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi ne Bukhari se is ke sahih hone ko naql kiya."
"396","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Waqid Laisi se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Azha aur Fitr mein Qaf aur Iqtarabat padhte the. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"397","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab Eid ka din hota to rasta badalte. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ke han Ibn Umar se isi tarah hai."
"398","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef lae jabke un ke do din the jin mein woh khelte the. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhen un donon ke badle un se behtar diya hai: Azha ka din aur Fitr ka din. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne sahih sanad se riwayat kiya."
"399","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke sunnat mein se hai ke Eid ki taraf paidal nikle. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise hasan kaha."
"400","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhen Eid ke din barish pahunchi to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen masjid mein Eid ki namaz padhai. Ise Abu Dawud ne narm sanad se riwayat kiya."
"401","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein suraj grahan hua jis din Ibrahim ka inteqal hua, to logon ne kaha: Ibrahim ki maut ke liye suraj grahan hua hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak suraj aur chand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain jo kisi ki maut ya zindagi ke liye grahan nahin hote; to jab tum unhen dekho to Allah se dua karo aur namaz padho yahan tak ke khul jae. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ki ek riwayat mein hai: Yahan tak ke saaf ho jae. Aur Bukhari ke han Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees se hai: To namaz padho aur dua karo yahan tak ke tum se jo hai khul jae."
"402","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Kusoof ki namaz mein qiraat buland awaz se ki, to do rak'aton mein chaar ruku kiye aur chaar sajde kiye. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur unhi ki ek riwayat mein hai ke Aap ne ek munadi bheja jo nida deta: Namaz jama karne wali hai."
"403","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein suraj grahan hua to Aap ne namaz padhi, to lamba qiyam kiya taqreeban Surah Baqarah ki qiraat jaisa, phir lamba ruku kiya, phir uth khade hue aur lamba qiyam kiya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kiya, phir khade hue aur lamba qiyam kiya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir uth khade hue aur lamba qiyam kiya jo pehle qiyam se kam tha, phir lamba ruku kiya jo pehle ruku se kam tha, phir sajda kiya, phir wapas hue jabke suraj saaf ho chuka tha, phir logon ko khutba diya. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain; aur Muslim ki ek riwayat mein hai ke jab suraj grahan hua to chaar sajdon mein aath rukuon wali namaz padhi. Aur Ali se isi tarah hai. Aur unhi ke han Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se hai ke chaar sajdon ke sath chhe ruku wali namaz padhi. Aur Abu Dawud ke han Ubayy bin Ka'b se hai ke Aap ne namaz padhi aur paanch ruku kiye aur do sajde kiye, aur doosri mein bhi aisa kiya."
"404","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke jab bhi hawa chali to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghutnon par baith gae aur farmaya: Aey Allah ise rahmat bana, ise azab na bana. Ise Shafi'i aur Tabarani ne riwayat kiya."
"405","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke unhon ne zalzale mein chhe ruku aur chaar sajde wali namaz padhi aur kaha: Nishaniyon ki namaz aisi hai. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya; aur Shafi'i ne Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi tarah zikr kiya us ke aakhir ke baghair."
"406","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aajizi karte hue, purane kapde pahne, khushu karte hue, aahista chalte hue, girya zari karte hue nikle, to do rak'aten padhin jaise Eid mein padhte, hamare is khutbe jaisa khutba na diya. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi, Abu Awanah aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"407","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se barish ke qaht ki shikayat ki, to Aap ne mimbar ka hukm diya jo eidgah mein rakha gaya, aur logon se ek din ka wa'da kiya jis mein woh niklen; phir jab suraj ka kinara zahir hua to bahar nikle aur mimbar par baithe, takbir kahi aur Allah ki hamd ki, phir farmaya: Beshak tum ne apne deyar ke qahat ki shikayat ki hai, aur Allah ne tumhen hukm diya hai ke use pukaro aur tum se wa'da kiya hai ke tumhare liye qabool karega; phir farmaya: Tamam hamd Allah ke liye jo jahano ka Rabb hai, bada raham wala nihayat raham wala hai, qiyamat ke din ka malik hai, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin jo chahta hai karta hai; Aey Allah Tu Allah hai, Tere siwa koi mabud nahin, Tu ghani hai aur ham faqeer hain, ham par barish nazil farma, aur jo nazil kare use waqt tak quwwat aur pahunch bana; phir dono hath uthae aur musalsal uthae rakhe yahan tak ke baghlon ki safedi dekhi gayi, phir logon ki taraf peeth ki aur chadar ulti, jabke dono hath uthae hue the, phir logon ki taraf mutawajjah hue aur utre aur do rak'aten padhin; to Allah ne badal paida kiya jo garja aur chamka, phir barsa. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur kaha: Ghareeb hai aur is ki sanad achchi hai. Aur chadar palatne ka qissa Sahih mein Abdullah bin Zaid ki hadees se hai, aur is mein hai ke qibla ki taraf mutawajjah hue, dua ki, phir do rak'aten padhin jin mein qiraat buland ki. Aur Daraqutni ke han Abu Ja'far Baqir ke mursal se hai ke chadar ulti taake qaht palat jae."
"408","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Juma ke din masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade khutba de rahe the, to us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Maal halak ho gae aur raste kat gae, to Allah Azza wa Jalla se dua kijiye ke hamen sair-ab kare. To Aap ne dono hath uthae, phir farmaya: Aey Allah hamen sair-ab farma, Aey Allah hamen sair-ab farma... Phir hadees zikr ki, aur is mein use rokne ki dua hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"409","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) jab qaht hota to Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib se istisqa farmate the, aur farmate: Aey Allah! Beshak ham Tere paas apne Nabi se istisqa karte the to Tu hamen sair-ab karta tha, aur beshak ham Tere paas apne Nabi ke chacha se waseela karte hain to hamen sair-ab farma; to woh sair-ab kiye jate. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"410","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se riwayat hai ke hamen barish pahunchi jabke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the, to Aap ne kapda hataya yahan tak ke barish Aap ko lagi, aur farmaya: Beshak yeh apne Rabb se nai mulaqat wali hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"411","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab barish dekhte to farmate: Aey Allah nafa bakhsh barsa. Dono ne ise riwayat kiya."
"412","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne istisqa mein dua ki: Aey Allah hamen ghana, bhaari, garajne wala, kheechnne wala, chamakne wala badal odha de, jo hamen halki boondon, danon, khub barsae, Aey jalal aur izzat wale. Ise Abu Awanah ne apne Sahih mein riwayat kiya."
"413","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sulaiman Alaihissalam istisqa ke liye nikle to unhon ne ek cheenti dekhi jo apni peeth par leti aasman ki taraf pair uthae keh rahi thi: Aey Allah! Beshak ham Teri makhlooq mein se ek makhlooq hain, hamen Teri sair-abi se be-niyazi nahin; to unhon ne farmaya: Wapas jao, beshak tumhen ghair ki dua se sair-ab kar diya gaya. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"414","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne istisqa kiya to dono hathlion ki pusht se aasman ki taraf ishara kiya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"415","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Amir Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se zaroor aise qaum honge jo sharmgah [zina] aur resham ko halal samjhenge. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki asl Bukhari mein hai."
"416","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke ham sone chandi ke bartanon mein piyen aur un mein khaen, aur resham aur dibaj pahne aur us par baithen. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"417","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne resham pahne se mana farmaya siwae do ya teen ya chaar unglion ki jagah ke. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"418","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abdur Rahman bin Awf aur Zubair ko safar mein resham ki qameez ki ruksat di, ek khujli ki wajah se jo un donon ko thi. Muttafaq alaih."
"419","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe seera wala joda pehnaya, to main us mein bahar nikla aur main ne Aap ke chehre mein gussa dekha, to main ne use apni aurton ke darmiyan phaad diya. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"420","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona aur resham meri ummat ki aurton ke liye halal kiya gaya aur un ke mardon par haram kiya gaya. Ise Ahmad, Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"421","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah pasand karta hai ke jab apne bande par nemat kare to us par apni nemat ka asar dekhe. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya."
"422","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qassi [reshmi kapda] aur mu'asfar [zafran ranga] pahne se mana farmaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"423","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh par za'frani range do kapde dekhe to farmaya: Kya tumhari walidah ne tumhen is ka hukm diya hai? Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"424","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka jubba nikala jis ke gireban, aasteen aur dono chaakon par dibaj laga tha. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Muslim mein hai aur izafa kiya ke woh Hazrat Aishah ke paas tha yahan tak ke un ka inteqal hua, to main ne use qabze mein le liya, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use pahnte the, to ham use beemaron ke liye dhote hain aur us se shifa mangte hain. Aur Bukhari ne Adab al-Mufrad mein izafa kiya ke Aap use wafd aur Juma ke liye pahnte the."
